          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"pricing.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n<meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n<title>Pricing — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n<style>\\n:root{--accent:#6b9b73;--muted:#7e8a98;--bg:#f7fbf8;--card:#ffffff;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.6)}\\nbody{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,\\\"Helvetica Neue\\\",Arial;color:#123;line-height:1.4;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f8fff8 0%,#eef6f0 60%);min-height:100vh}\\n.header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:28px 36px}\\n.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}\\n.logo{width:56px;height:56px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%,var(--accent),#4b7a58);border-radius:12px;display:inline-grid;place-items:center;color:#fff;font-weight:700}\\nnav a{margin-left:18px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}\\n.hero{padding:48px 36px;background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"800\\\" height=\\\"300\\\"><defs><linearGradient id=\\\"g\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" y1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\" y2=\\\"1\\\"><stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"%236b9b73\\\"/><stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"%239cc48e\\\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" fill=\\\"url(%23g)\\\" opacity=\\\"0.06\\\"/></svg>');border-radius:12px;margin:18px 36px}\\n.hero .inner{display:flex;gap:28px;align-items:center}\\n.h-cta{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#4b7a58);color:#fff;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}\\n.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:20px;margin:18px 36px 60px}\\n.card{background:var(--card);padding:22px;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(18,34,24,0.06)}\\n.price{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;font-size:28px;font-weight:700}\\n.list{margin-top:12px;color:var(--muted)}\\n.plan{border-radius:12px;padding:18px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#f6fbf6);border:1px solid rgba(76,99,81,0.08)}\\n.small{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}\\n.footer-cta{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin:18px 36px 60px}\\n.testimonials{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-direction:column}\\n.testimonial{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#f8fff8);padding:16px;border-radius:12px;border-left:4px solid rgba(107,155,115,0.14)}\\n.badge{display:inline-block;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(107,155,115,0.12);color:var(--accent);font-weight:700}\\n.note{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n</style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n<header class=\\\"header\\\"><div class=\\\"brand\\\"><div class=\\\"logo\\\">HM</div><div><div style=\\\"font-weight:800\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div><div class=\\\"small\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div></div></div><nav><a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a><a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Modalities</a><a href=\\\"approach.html\\\">Process</a><a href=\\\"book.html\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a></nav></header>\\n<section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"inner\\\">\\n<div>\\n<h1 style=\\\"margin:0\\\">Transparent care, tailored plans</h1>\\n<p class=\\\"small\\\" style=\\\"max-width:52ch\\\">We combine evidence-informed integrative medicine with whole-person coaching. Choose the pace and scope that fits your life—no quick fixes, only thoughtful steps.</p>\\n<div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\"><a class=\\\"h-cta\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a></div>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\\"margin-left:auto\\\" class=\\\"card\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"badge\\\">Pricing & Packages</div>\\n<div class=\\\"list\\\">Quick reference for common engagements. All plans begin with a focused intake to align goals and safety.</div>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n</section>\\n<main class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n<section class=\\\"card\\\">\\n<h2>Packages arranged for clarity</h2>\\n<p class=\\\"small\\\">You choose a path: focused assessment, short-term support, or an immersive VIP Day for deep work. Each plan is educational and individualized.</p>\\n<div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:16px\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"plan\\\" style=\\\"flex:1\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"price\\\">$225</div>\\n<div class=\\\"small\\\">Single follow-up visit (45 minutes)</div>\\n<ul class=\\\"list\\\"><li>Focused review</li><li>Adjustments and resources</li><li>Referrals if needed</li></ul>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\\"plan\\\" style=\\\"width:220px\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"price\\\">$850</div>\\n<div class=\\\"small\\\">Short package (3 visits)</div>\\n<ul class=\\\"list\\\"><li>Intake + 2 follow-ups</li><li>Personalized plan</li><li>Email support</li></ul>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n<h3 style=\\\"margin-top:20px\\\">VIP Day — immersive, practical</h3>\\n<p class=\\\"small\\\">One full day with {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, combining deep intake, guided sessions, optional point-of-care labs, and an action plan you can use immediately.</p>\\n<div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:12px\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"plan\\\" style=\\\"flex:1;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fff8f2,#fff);border:1px solid rgba(156,196,142,0.12)\\\"><div class=\\\"price\\\">$2400</div><div class=\\\"small\\\">VIP Day — single-session intensive</div><ul class=\\\"list\\\"><li>Whole-person intake</li><li>Guided movement and nutrition strategies</li><li>Comprehensive written plan</li></ul></div>\\n</div>\\n<p class=\\\"note\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">Price variations may apply for labs, supplements, or extended programs. No promises of cure—care focuses on symptom education and sustainable strategies.</p>\\n</section>\\n<aside>\\n<div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n<h3>Why choose a VIP Day?</h3>\\n<p class=\\\"small\\\">For complex concerns or when you want a clear road map quickly. It's ideal for busy people who prefer an immersive, focused approach.</p>\\n<div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\"><a class=\\\"h-cta\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book VIP Day</a></div>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:14px\\\">\\n<h4>Insurance & payments</h4>\\n<p class=\\\"small\\\">We accept out-of-pocket payments and can provide superbills for possible reimbursement. Contact {{EMAIL}} for billing help.</p>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:14px\\\">\\n<h4>Testimonials</h4>\\n<div class=\\\"testimonials\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"testimonial\\\"><strong>A thoughtful reset</strong><div class=\\\"small\\\">\\\"I left with clarity and practical steps to improve sleep and energy.\\\" — A. from {{CITY}}</div></div>\\n<div class=\\\"testimonial\\\"><strong>Efficient and kind</strong><div class=\\\"small\\\">\\\"The VIP Day saved me months of trial-and-error.\\\" — M. from {{STATE}}</div></div>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n</aside>\\n</main>\\n<section style=\\\"margin:0 36px 60px\\\" class=\\\"card\\\">\\n<h3>How to get started</h3>\\n<p class=\\\"small\\\">Begin with a short intake; we'll discuss goals, safety considerations, and whether targeted labs are helpful for your situation.</p>\\n<div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:12px;\\\">\\n<a class=\\\"h-cta\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n<a style=\\\"padding:12px 16px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(18,34,24,0.06);text-decoration:none;color:var(--muted)\\\" href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Ask a question</a>\\n</div>\\n</section>\\n<footer style=\\\"padding:28px 36px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted)\\\">© {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}} • <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a> • {{PHONE}}</footer>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"}\n{\"path\":\"about.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n<meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n<title>About — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n<style>\\n:root{--accent:#7a6bb0;--muted:#596072;--bg:#fbfbfe}\\nbody{margin:0;font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial;color:#1b1f23;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fbfaff,#f3f6ff 60%);min-height:100vh}\\n.header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:22px 36px}\\n.brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}\\n.logo{width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#6153a0);color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:800}\\nnav a{margin-left:16px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}\\n.hero{padding:44px 36px;border-radius:12px;margin:18px 36px;overflow:hidden;position:relative;background:radial-gradient(circle at 10% 20%,rgba(122,107,176,0.06),transparent 30%)}\\n.hero svg{position:absolute;right:10px;top:10px;opacity:0.12;width:220px}\\n.story{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:20px;margin:18px 36px}\\n.bio{background:#fff;padding:20px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(9,10,11,0.04)}\\n.grid-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-top:10px}\\n.section{background:#fff;margin:18px 36px;padding:18px;border-radius:12px}\\n.kv{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start}\\n.kv strong{width:140px;color:var(--accent)}\\n.cta{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}\\n</style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n<header class=\\\"header\\\"><div class=\\\"brand\\\"><div class=\\\"logo\\\">HM</div><div><div style=\\\"font-weight:800\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div><div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div></div></div><nav><a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Start</a><a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Treatments</a><a href=\\\"approach.html\\\">Our Way</a><a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Schedule</a></nav></header>\\n<section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n<h1 style=\\\"margin:0\\\">A whole-person practice grounded in clarity</h1>\\n<p style=\\\"margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)\\\">We view health as an ecosystem: symptoms are signals, not secrets. Our job is to translate those signals into a sustainable, individualized plan.</p>\\n<svg aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 200 120\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\"><defs><linearGradient id=\\\"a\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\"><stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#7a6bb0\\\"/><stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#9b8fd2\\\"/></linearGradient></defs><rect x=\\\"0\\\" y=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"200\\\" height=\\\"120\\\" fill=\\\"url(#a)\\\"/></svg>\\n</section>\\n<main>\\n<section class=\\\"story\\\">\\n<article class=\\\"bio\\\">\\n<h2>Meet {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}</h2>\\n<p class=\\\"small\\\">A clinician and educator who blends conventional knowledge with lifestyle, movement, and nutritional strategies. Education and shared decision-making are central to every visit.</p>\\n<div class=\\\"grid-list\\\">\\n<div><strong>Philosophy</strong><div class=\\\"small\\\">Safety first, curiosity second. We examine systems, not only symptoms.</div></div>\\n<div><strong>Approach</strong><div class=\\\"small\\\">Integrative evaluation with optional targeted labs when clinically indicated.</div></div>\\n</div>\\n</article>\\n<aside class=\\\"bio\\\">\\n<h3>Quick facts</h3>\\n<div class=\\\"small\\\"><strong>Location:</strong> {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n<div class=\\\"small\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\"><strong>Contact:</strong> <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n<div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\"><a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Request a consult</a></div>\\n</aside>\\n</section>\\n<section class=\\\"section\\\">\\n<h3>How care unfolds</h3>\\n<div class=\\\"kv\\\"><strong>1. Intake</strong><div class=\\\"small\\\">Comprehensive review of history, current needs, and goals. Safety screening and medication review.</div></div>\\n<div class=\\\"kv\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\"><strong>2. Tailored plan</strong><div class=\\\"small\\\">Education, practical strategies, and when appropriate, recommendations for labs or referrals. No guaranteed cures—focus is on understanding and manageable steps.</div></div>\\n<div class=\\\"kv\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\"><strong>3. Follow-up</strong><div class=\\\"small\\\">Short, structured check-ins to track progress and adjust the plan.</div></div>\\n<div class=\\\"kv\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\"><strong>4. Optional labs</strong><div class=\\\"small\\\">Selective testing explained with benefits, limits, and costs. Labs are offered for clarity, not as a shortcut.</div></div>\\n</section>\\n<section class=\\\"section\\\">\\n<h3>Services & offerings</h3>\\n<p class=\\\"small\\\">We offer single visits, short packages, and immersive VIP Day sessions for clients seeking concentrated time to address complex concerns.</p>\\n<ul class=\\\"small\\\">\\n<li>Single follow-up visits</li>\\n<li>3-visit short packages</li>\\n<li>VIP Day intensives</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p class=\\\"small\\\">Costs vary; billing is transparent and discussed before tests or supplements are recommended.</p>\\n</section>\\n<section class=\\\"section\\\">\\n<h3>What people say</h3>\\n<div class=\\\"testimonial\\\" style=\\\"background:#fff;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(9,10,11,0.04)\\\"><strong>Clear guidance</strong><div class=\\\"small\\\">\\\"Helpful education and a stepwise plan that respected my life constraints.\\\" — J.</div></div>\\n</section>\\n<section style=\\\"margin:18px 36px\\\" class=\\\"section\\\">\\n<h3>Ready to start?</h3>\\n<p class=\\\"small\\\">If you have questions about fit, insurance, or timing, reach out. We prioritize safe, evidence-informed care.</p>\\n<div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\"><a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a></div>\\n</section>\\n</main>\\n<footer style=\\\"padding:28px 36px;color:var(--muted);text-align:center\\\">© {{BUSINESS_NAME}} • {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}} • <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></footer>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"book.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n<meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n<title>Book — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n<style>\\n:root{--accent:#d97b5f;--muted:#5b4a46}\\nbody{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial;color:#222;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff7f4,#fffdfd);min-height:100vh}\\n.header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:20px 36px}\\n.logo{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#b86a52);display:grid;place-items:center;color:#fff;font-weight:800}\\nnav a{margin-left:14px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}\\n.container{max-width:980px;margin:18px auto;padding:0 18px}\\n.hero{padding:30px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(217,123,95,0.06),transparent);border-radius:12px}\\n.form-card{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:18px;margin-top:18px}\\n.form{background:#fff;padding:18px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04)}\\n.side{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fff8f6);padding:18px;border-radius:12px}\\n.input{width:100%;padding:10px;margin-top:6px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6e2e0}\\n.button{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#b86a52);color:#fff;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:10px;border:none;font-weight:700}\\n.note{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n.schedule{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-top:12px}\\n.item{background:#fff;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04)}\\n</style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n<header class=\\\"header\\\"><div style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px\\\"><div class=\\\"logo\\\">HM</div><div><strong>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong><div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div></div></div><nav><a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Back</a><a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Care</a><a href=\\\"approach.html\\\">Method</a><a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Contact</a></nav></header>\\n<div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n<section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n<h1 style=\\\"margin:0\\\">Reserve time that respects your needs</h1>\\n<p class=\\\"note\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Select an option below to request availability. For urgent matters, call {{PHONE}}.</p>\\n</section>\\n<form class=\\\"form-card\\\" action=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" method=\\\"post\\\">\\n<section class=\\\"form\\\">\\n<h3>Request an appointment</h3>\\n<label class=\\\"note\\\">Full name<input class=\\\"input\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" required></label>\\n<label class=\\\"note\\\" style=\\\"display:block;margin-top:8px\\\">Phone<input class=\\\"input\\\" name=\\\"phone\\\" value=\\\"{{PHONE}}\\\"></label>\\n<label class=\\\"note\\\" style=\\\"display:block;margin-top:8px\\\">Email<input class=\\\"input\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" value=\\\"{{EMAIL}}\\\" required></label>\\n<label class=\\\"note\\\" style=\\\"display:block;margin-top:8px\\\">Preferred date<input class=\\\"input\\\" name=\\\"date\\\" type=\\\"date\\\"></label>\\n<label class=\\\"note\\\" style=\\\"display:block;margin-top:8px\\\">Type<select class=\\\"input\\\" name=\\\"type\\\"><option>Single visit</option><option>3-visit package</option><option>VIP Day</option></select></label>\\n<label class=\\\"note\\\" style=\\\"display:block;margin-top:8px\\\">Message<textarea class=\\\"input\\\" name=\\\"message\\\" rows=\\\"4\\\"></textarea></label>\\n<div style=\\\"margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:10px\\\"><button class=\\\"button\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button><a style=\\\"padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06);text-decoration:none;color:var(--muted)\\\" href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Ask first</a></div>\\n<p class=\\\"note\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">By submitting you consent to messaging for scheduling. We do not promise cures; care emphasizes education and whole-person plans.</p>\\n</section>\\n<aside class=\\\"side\\\">\\n<h4>Available offerings</h4>\\n<div class=\\\"schedule\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"item\\\"><strong>VIP Day — $2400</strong><div class=\\\"note\\\">Full-day intensive, intake + protocols + plan.</div></div>\\n<div class=\\\"item\\\"><strong>Short Package — $850</strong><div class=\\\"note\\\">3 visits focused on plan and follow-up.</div></div>\\n<div class=\\\"item\\\"><strong>Single Visit — $225</strong><div class=\\\"note\\\">45-minute focused follow-up.</div></div>\\n</div>\\n<h4 style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">What to expect</h4>\\n<p class=\\\"note\\\">After you request a slot we confirm details, review medications, and suggest whether labs might help clarify care. Tests are optional and discussed transparently.</p>\\n<div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\"><a class=\\\"button\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a></div>\\n</aside>\\n</form>\\n<section style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n<h3>VIP Day outline</h3>\\n<p class=\\\"note\\\">A structured day with education, movement, practical meal planning, and a written roadmap. Labs may be offered to add clarity, always with discussion of costs and limits.</p>\\n<ul class=\\\"note\\\">\\n<li>Comprehensive intake</li><li>Real-time assessments and coaching</li><li>Take-home plan and resources</li></ul>\\n</section>\\n<section style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n<h3>Testimonials</h3>\\n<div class=\\\"item\\\" style=\\\"border-left:4px solid rgba(217,123,95,0.12)\\\"><strong>Actionable and kind</strong><div class=\\\"note\\\">\\\"The schedule gave me tools and momentum.\\\" — R.</div></div>\\n</section>\\n</div>\\n<footer style=\\\"padding:28px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted)\\\">© {{BUSINESS_NAME}} • <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a> • {{PHONE}}</footer>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \nBUNDLE_END"
